# Budget

// tags group the categories; the views update as you type.
// amounts are rates: /period keeps it in every answer, and the
// totals stay dimension-checked (this one mixes /month and /year)

## Income
paycheck = 2400/month @income
side = 4200/year @income

## Fixed
rent = 950/month @fixed
utilities = 120/month @fixed
internet = 45/month @fixed

## Variable
groceries = 320/month @variable
transport = 90/month @variable
fun = 150/month @fun

## The picture
total @income
total @fixed
total @variable
total @fun
leftover = paycheck + side - (rent + utilities + internet + groceries + transport + fun)
total
